This project is an independently maintained MCP server that integrates with UniFi's public
Site Manager API as a third-party tool.

schemas/server.schema.json is the MCP Registry server.json schema (2025-12-11), copied
unmodified from https://static.modelcontextprotocol.io/schemas/2025-12-11/server.schema.json,
which the Model Context Protocol registry project generates
(https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/registry). That project licenses new contributions
under the Apache License 2.0; contributions not relicensed remain under the MIT License. See
https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/registry/blob/main/LICENSE.

The diagnostic bundle (src/unifi_fabric/diagnostic_bundle.py) follows the design of the
sanitized support bundle in sirkirby/unifi-mcp
(https://github.com/sirkirby/unifi-mcp/tree/7a40f40fd2af69bc5cd0c6b531888f54601cc613),
Copyright (c) 2025 Chris Kirby, MIT License: local cached diagnostics kept separate from an
explicit allowlist of live probes. Credit to its maintainers and contributors. No code from
that project is copied or adapted here.
